timeline.body:
@dakrone the documentation for the API doesn't go into details about how exactly it migrates the entities. We have the manual migration guide that does. I've updated the guide in https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/81940/commits/8ba044c71f0348e159ac7c075a0c2739eff0c1d7

Maybe we should rework the docs for the API to be more detailed? Especially with https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/82170 coming in soon? Or maybe it's ok we're keeping the docs rather high level? @debadair what do you think? 

@dakrone in any case, I think if we decide to refactor the docs we should do that in a follow-up and take https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/82170 into account once that's done. What do you think?
